/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `products` DISABLE KEYS */;
INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (43,'Funskool Giggles Bear Melody Crib Mobile','8901383100610','WHAT’S INCLUDED: This calming crib mobile set comes with a top stand, a bottom stand featuring a secure clamping screw, a plane-shaped musical mobile unit, and a rotating fan that has 3 cute parachute bears (already put together).\r\nRELAXING MUSICAL EXPERIENCE: It softly plays soothing tunes meant to help your little one drift off to sleep peacefully. The gentle rotation and calming sounds create a serene sleep atmosphere, making bedtime a more pleasant experience for both baby and parents.\r\nVISUAL & SENSORY GROWTH: The brightly colored parachute bears sway gently to the music, engaging your baby\'s visual senses and attention. It also promotes early tracking abilities and spatial awareness in newborns and infants.\r\nIDEAL GIFT FOR NEWBORNS: A lovely and considerate present for new parents, baby showers, or first birthdays. Its adorable design and soothing features make it a wonderful addition to any nursery, perfect for both boys and girls.\r\nSAFE & USER-FRIENDLY: Made for babies from 0 months and older. The mobile fits easily on most cots and cribs, and the clamp guarantees a secure fit. Crafted from baby-safe, non-toxic materials for peace of mind during rest and play.',1499.00,10.00,1350.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'0-18 Months','Unisex','2025-10-31 09:21:59','2026-03-27 07:34:47',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,NULL,0),(46,'Funskool Giggles Bear Melody Crib Mobile','8901383100610','WHAT’S INCLUDED: This calming crib mobile set comes with a top stand, a bottom stand featuring a secure clamping screw, a plane-shaped musical mobile unit, and a rotating fan that has 3 cute parachute bears (already put together).\r\nRELAXING MUSICAL EXPERIENCE: It softly plays soothing tunes meant to help your little one drift off to sleep peacefully. The gentle rotation and calming sounds create a serene sleep atmosphere, making bedtime a more pleasant experience for both baby and parents.\r\nVISUAL & SENSORY GROWTH: The brightly colored parachute bears sway gently to the music, engaging your baby\'s visual senses and attention. It also promotes early tracking abilities and spatial awareness in newborns and infants.\r\nIDEAL GIFT FOR NEWBORNS: A lovely and considerate present for new parents, baby showers, or first birthdays. Its adorable design and soothing features make it a wonderful addition to any nursery, perfect for both boys and girls.\r\nSAFE & USER-FRIENDLY: Made for babies from 0 months and older. The mobile fits easily on most cots and cribs, and the clamp guarantees a secure fit. Crafted from baby-safe, non-toxic materials for peace of mind during rest and play.',1499.00,10.00,1350.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'0-18 Months','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-02-11 07:46:41',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/product-46-1766667874834.jpeg',0),(47,'Funskool Giggles Babys Best Friends','8901383969484','Baby\'s Best Friends is the perfect infant gift pack, with three delightful toys in one package. Baby\'s Best Friends not only provides comfort during teething but also offers engaging sensory experiences and entertainment, making it an excellent gift for infants, sure to become their best companions during early developmental stages.',449.00,10.00,405.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'4+MONTHS','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-27 07:19:55',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769026929429-477590735.jpg',0),(48,'Funskool Giggles Thing a Ding Dings','8901383092014','Funskool thing a ding dings set, featuring 22 interchangeable parts, it can be used to make several combinations, so you get a new toy by joining the different parts. Flaunting bright and attractive colours with innovative designs, each toy type looks pretty and eye-catching.',649.00,10.00,585.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'3-6 Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-11 06:13:26',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,NULL,0),(49,'Funskool Giggles Learn & Write 2 In 1 Magnetic And Writing Board','8901383991744','Engage your child in hours of educational play with the Learn & Write 2-in-1 Board! Featuring an erasable whiteboard on one side and a magnetic board on the other, this versatile board allows children to practice writing with a marker and explore magnetic letters and numbers. Designed to make early learning enjoyable and interactive!',899.00,10.00,810.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'3+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-02-11 07:48:48',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769167388863-437345547.jpg',0),(50,'Funskool Giggles Mini Doodle','8901383992345','',999.00,10.00,899.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'4+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-01-07 06:38:22',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/product-50-1766667874873.jpeg',0),(51,'Funskool Giggles Giftset Mini','8901383969439','',399.00,10.00,359.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,2,'6+MONTHS','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-01-07 06:38:22',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/product-51-1766667874878.jpeg',0),(52,'Funskool Giggles Push & Crawl Monkey','8901383964489','Funskool giggles push and crawl monkey, is a safe, visually stimulating fun toy for infants from six months plus, who are all eager to move and crawl. Preferred gift to encourage infant crawl and interact by pushing. Sound of rattling beads and smooth soft curves delight infants. Designed to support the initial gross motor skills the toy is safe to hold and play too.',599.00,10.00,540.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,2,'6+MONTHS','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-11 06:12:01',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,NULL,0),(53,'Funskool Giggles Nico The Giraffe','8901383510563','A pull along companion for toddlers. They will love pulling Nico along as he bobs his head, wags his tail and walks with them. Nico has a fun walking style with its moving legs. Nico has a rotatable tail that wags as he moves. Encourages toddlers to walk and improve motor skills. Develops balance an