s included, it offers great value and hours of entertainment while supporting children\'s mental and developmental growth.',299.00,10.00,270.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'4+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-27 07:25:10',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769023115366-852266915.jpg',0),(76,'Funskool Play & Learn The Water Cycle Puzzle 104 Pcs','8901383942586','Solve this 104 pieces puzzle to learn all about the water cycle! This colourful illustration makes learning easy and fun! All the information you need to know about the movement of water through the cycle packed into one amazing puzzle!',249.00,10.00,225.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'6+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-27 07:25:16',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769023069920-938149196.jpg',0),(77,'Funskool Rummikub Joy','8901383493934','Rummikub Joy is the perfect blend of luck and logic, bringing family and friends together for endless tile-based fun. Players race to place and rearrange numbered tiles into smart combinations, aiming to be the first to clear their rack. With quick setup, intuitive rules, and strategic depth, it’s a game that’s easy to learn but keeps you coming back for more. Designed for 2 to 4 players and suitable for ages 7 and up, Rummikub Joy is ideal for family game nights, holiday gatherings, or casual fun with friends. Bright tiles, smooth gameplay, and timeless appeal — it’s everything a great board game should be.',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'7+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-27 07:25:23',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772859570977-838773415.jpg',0),(78,'Funskool Play & Learn Aqarium Life Under The Water 300Pcs Puzzle','8901383960412','WHAT’S IN THE BOX: Inside, you’ll find a beautifully illustrated 300-piece jigsaw puzzle with an aquarium theme. The puzzle features vibrant, realistic images of underwater life. The pieces are clean-cut and fit together perfectly, making it a fun 