g pieces and an exciting wildlife theme, this puzzle offers both educational and entertainment benefits. It’s an affordable option that provides hours of fun and learning.\r\nFOR AGE GROUP: Ideal for kids aged 9 and up due to its complexity. The large, easy-to-grip pieces also make it a great choice for adults and older kids seeking a relaxing or collaborative pastime.',399.00,10.00,360.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'9+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-27 07:25:40',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772860348884-420241424.jpg',0),(80,'Funskool Giggles Front & Back Memory','8901383401410','WHAT’S INSIDE: Comes with 72 colorful picture cards that showcase both the front and back of different objects, aimed at making a fun and educational memory game for kids.\r\nSKILL DEVELOPMENT: Encourages visual recognition, focus, and memory enhancement through engaging card matching great for boosting early cognitive skills.\r\nHOW TO PLAY: Players turn over cards to find matching front and back images; the player with the most pairs at the end wins. It can be enjoyed solo or with up to 4 players for some family fun.\r\nAGE GROUP: Perfect for kids aged 4 and up; the easy rules make it accessible for younger children while still being entertaining for older ones.\r\nPERFECT GIFT OPTION: An excellent educational present that merges learning with play, making it ideal for birthdays, holidays, or just casual playtime with friends and family.',249.00,10.00,225.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'3-8 Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-02-25 16:40:51',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769021539522-865256929.jpg',0),(81,'Funskool Murder Mystery Party Jigsaw Puzzle Death On The Istanbul Express','8901383960092',' It was who, where and with what? Read the story. Next, assemble the 1000-piece jigsaw puzzle and review the puzzle for clues. Then solve a classic mystery by piecing together clues from the story and puzzle. Beware! The puzzle is different from the box cover. Assembled puzzle measures approximately 73.6 cm x 58.4 cm.\r\n\r\n',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,0,'14+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-27 07:25:52',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772860319366-826606140.jpg',0),(82,'Funskool Murder Mystery Party Jigsaw Puzzle Sherlock Homes And The Speckled Band','8901383960085','Sherlock Holmes and the Speckled Band is more than just a jigsaw puzzle. It\'s a murder mystery waiting to be solved. Read the included story and learn of the mysterious death behind the gates of Stoke Moran Manor House. The puzzle is based on the famous story by Sir Arthur Conan Doyle. Assemble the puzzle to uncover the hidden clues. Match wits with a criminal mastermind. Can you solve \'\'The Mystery of the Speckled Band?\'\' A wonderful gift for puzzlers and fans of Sherlock Holmes. The 1,000 piece puzzle creates a 73.6 cm x 58.4 cm image. For ages 14 and up. BePuzzled is more than just jigsaw puzzles. It\'s puzzle-plus. Not only do we develop interesting jigsaws, but we also apply our University Games game development expertise, using it to build special added value into our products. You\'ll find a wide range of entertaining puzzles for children and adults.',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,0,'14+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-03-11 05:54:50',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772860303595-702655822.jpg',0),(83,'Funskool Handy Crafts My Kaleidoscope','8901383130099','Funskool my kaleidoscope (a unique optical illusion kit ), is a diy kit that a child can easily learn to assemble, color and to create visual magic by self. The kaleidoscope encourages imagination and exploration. When the child twists and turns a kaleidoscope, vibrant patterns and colorful combinations in perfectly beautiful and symmetrical forms appear. Kids will love making this kaleidoscope almost as much as they\'ll enjoy playing with it afterward crafting is an excellent opportunity for a family to spend quality time together and bond. A cheerful gift with creative approach to pep up any child\'s day a gift to keep forever from the manufacturer: Easy to create: The child is easily engaged with the process of making this kaleidoscope, and will enjoy playing with her or his creation with total satisfaction and excitement. The kit along with its different elements, is broken down to simple steps that is easy to assemble. Sense of responsibility: By handling different elements in the pack starting from small beads, colors, brushes, to bigger components such as lens - the child feels the responsibility of taking care of each element till the finish. Learns to follow instructions: This kit teaches the importance of following instructions. Whether it is handling the bead, coloring the lenses or body of kaleidoscope, putting together each component as per the steps given is important for the magic to work finally skills development.',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'2-10 Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-02-12 20:43:43',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769021436022-52868007.jpg',0),(84,'Funskool Handy Crafts Diy Thread Bangles','8901383959539','This DIY Thread Bangle Set helps in creating multi-coloured bangles with ease, in circular and hexagonal shapes. It is a perfect art and craft playset for little girls. The vibrant threads can instantly encourage the kids to make and flaunt their creation.',399.00,10.00,360.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,0,'6+ Years','Girl','2025-10-31 14:14:20','2026-02-12 20:43:18',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769026681822-562563612.jpg',0),(87,'Funskool Handy Crafts Nail Art Parlour Set','8901383962720','Toys and Games;Pursuing creative activities with children is a healthy way to help them grow and learn\r\nCreative activities engage a child\'s imagination and inspire his thoughts and perceptions\r\nCreative activities present opportunities to problem-solve, challenging a child\'s thinking\r\nSize Name: Standard; Item Type Name: Art & Crafts; Age Range Description: Kid\r\nSize Name: Standard; Item Type Name: Art & Crafts; Age Range Description: Kid',349.00,10.00,315.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'6+ Years','Girl','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-11 09:05:01',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,NULL,0),(88,'Funskool Handy Crafts Sun Catchers','8901383901934','Evoke the artist in you\r\nArtistic Glass painting\r\nCombination of beautiful colors\r\n6 years and above',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'6+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-02-12 20:37:45',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769023019972-905223006.jpg',0),(89,'Funskool Handy Crafts Madhubani','8901383959713','Madhubani is an Indian art form that is also known as “Mithila painting “is a style of painting practiced in the Mithila region of India and Nepal. Artists create these paintings using a variety of mediums, including their fingers, or twigs, brushes, nib-pens, and matchsticks. Madhubani paintings depict people and their association with nature and deities from the ancient epics. Natural objects such as the sun, the moon, and religious plants are also widely painted, along with scenes from the royal court and social events like weddings. In these paintings generally, no space is left empty; the gaps are filled by paintings of flowers, animals, birds, and even geometric designs. Funskool\'s Madhubani Kit has two premarked Madhubani sceneries on both sides of a bag that can be painted using the paint provided in the kit using brushes.',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'6+ Years','Girl','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-11 08:36:58',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,NULL,0),(90,'Funskool Handy Crafts Quilling','8901383966063','Super fast delivery on Amazon Now',399.00,10.00,360.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'7+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-02-12 20:38:04',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769026911401-91458547.jpg',0),(9