the opportunity to block the other\'s attempts to connect their own discs! When the game is done for the day, it\'s easy to store the discs in the columns and fold up the trays on the playing grid. Kids ages 6 and up and adults alike can have Connect 4 fun nearly anywhere when they play with this portable Connect 4 game! Hasbro Gaming and all related terms are trademarks of Hasbro.',449.00,10.00,405.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'6 to 12 Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-06 01:28:23',37,NULL,'','','Hasbro Gaming',0,0,'/uploads/products/product-98-1766667875352.jpeg',0),(99,'Hasbro Marvel Iron Man','5010996274304','With the Marvel 6-inch Iron Man Action Figure, boys and girls can imagine playing as their favorite super hero and saving the world! This Iron Man toy features articulated points so kids can easily pose figures during playtime, or to show them off in an awesome display. Iron Man figure is inspired by the Marvel universe and features iconic character design and deco. Toy figure is packaged in its own Marvel-branded open window box and makes a great Marvel gift for boys and girls, and an awesome addition to any toy collection. Look for more Marvel toys for the ultimate pretend Super Hero experience! (Each sold separately. Subject to availability.) Copyright MARVEL. All trademarks and registered trademarks are the property of their respective owners. HASBRO and all related trademarks and logos are trademarks of Hasbro, Inc.',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'4+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-11 08:27:39',37,NULL,'','','Hasbro',0,0,NULL,0),(100,'Hasbro Marvel Spider Man','5010996274328','Peter Parker swings into battle as the web-slinging hero, Spider-Man! Kids can stand up this hero in their Marvel Super Hero and Super Villain figure collection to imagine a super battle for the ages! This 6-inch figure features classic design and styling, so kids can imagine scenes from the Marvel Universe happening right before their eyes