ica toy features articulated points so kids can easily pose figures during playtime, or to show them off in an awesome display. Captain America figure is inspired by the Marvel universe and features iconic character design and deco. Toy figure is packaged in its own Marvel-branded open window box and makes a great Marvel gift for boys and girls, and an awesome addition to any toy collection. Look for more Marvel toys for the ultimate pretend Super Hero experience! (Each sold separately. Subject to availability.) Copyright MARVEL. All trademarks and registered trademarks are the property of their respective owners. HASBRO and all related trademarks and logos are trademarks of Hasbro, Inc.',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'4+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-11 08:26:33',37,NULL,'','','Hasbro',0,0,NULL,0),(104,'Hasbro Connect 4 Card Game','630509886081','The Connect 4 card game is the favorite 4-in-a-row game as a fast, fun card game! In this version of the Connect 4 game, players choose 2 Mission cards from the deck and keep their patterns a secret. Then they draw Connect 4 Tiles and try to arrange patterns that match their Missions. Whether it\'s matching 4 in a row of purple, getting a square in green, or matching Tiles to get an \"L\" shape in yellow, it\'s an exciting and suspenseful strategy game for kids. Drawing a Tile card with a Power-Up symbol lets players do one-time actions that can change the course of the game in a second. Players aim to complete 4 Missions for the win. This quick-playing Connect 4 card game is a convenient and fun travel game for kids.',299.00,10.00,270.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,2,'6+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-11 07:25:37',37,NULL,'','','Hasbro',0,0,NULL,0),(105,'Hasbro Battleship Card Game','630509875719','It\'s the Classic Naval Combat Game with a twist. Kids can enjoy a different kind of Battleship gameplay with this fun, fast card game',349.00,10.00,315.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,2,'7+ Ye