lor Name: Multicolor',499.00,10.00,450.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'4+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-11 06:25:03',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,NULL,0),(137,'Funskool Game Of The States','8901383957108','WHAT’S INSIDE: Comes with a game board, 92 pieces that include state cards, tokens, play money, and more everything you need for a fun geography-themed board game.\r\nEDUCATIONAL BENEFITS: Helps kids learn about India’s states, capitals, important industries, and products, while also teaching them about trade, money, and economic exchanges.\r\nGIFTING VALUE: A special and thoughtful gift that mixes enjoyment with education perfect for birthdays, educational incentives, or family game nights.\r\nAGE GROUP: Great for kids aged 6 and up; made for 2 to 4 players, making it an enjoyable and competitive group activity for both children and families.\r\nSKILL DEVELOPMENT: Improves knowledge of Indian geography, enhances memory, promotes strategic thinking, and nurtures a sense of national pride.',399.00,10.00,360.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'6+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-02-12 20:55:29',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1769023144634-939322645.jpg',0),(138,'Funskool Spinning Top','8901383954756','The wooden spinning top is one of the oldest toys in the world\r\nOur spinning tops are perfect for solo as well as competitive gameplay\r\nLets go for a Spin today!\r\nAge: 6+',339.00,10.00,306.00,'image/jpeg','toys',5,1,'6+ Years','Unisex','2025-10-31 14:14:21','2026-03-27 07:17:58',37,NULL,'','','Funskool',0,0,'/uploads/products/1774595871704-534342669.jpg',0),(139,'Funskool Rummikub Classic','8901383493910','GAME FOR EVERYONE: Funskool Rummikub Classic is a amazing, tile-based game that mixes strategy, numbers, and logic. It\'s perfect for ages 7 and up, improving pattern recognition, planning, and problem-solving skills—ideal for family game nights, classrooms, or casual hangouts.\r\nIDEAL FOR AGES 7 AND UP: Designed for 2 to 4 pla