d slime kit designed to promote STEM-based learning through imagination.\r\nThe kit is crafted with non-toxic, 100% safe ingredients, ensuring worry-free creativity and peace of mind. It’s also designed to be suitable for all ages, making it perfect for everyone to enjoy.\r\nKits combine fun playtime with educational benefits, making it an ideal gift for birthdays or playdates. The slime kits blend the joy of play with engaging STEM-based learning concepts, including polymers and chemical reactions. The variety of scents and colors also enhances sensory recognition, helping to develop both smell and color identification skills.\r\nDIYScience 2-in-1 Slime Kit is also available with Strawberry Cheesecake, Pina Colada and Orange Choco Truffle.',699.00,10.00,630.00,NULL,'toys',5,1,'8+ Above','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:29','2026-03-08 11:22:23',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'DIYScience',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772968943541-514060516.jpg',0),(1456,'DIY SCIENCE PINA COLADA SLIME KIT FLDSSLM019','8908017463530','This DIYScience Pina Colada 2-in-1 Slime Kit lets you create two amazing scented slimes inspired by the classic tropical pina colada. Make both pineapple-scented and coconut-scented slimes that capture the essence of a pina colada. It also features a tropical coconut aroma with a smooth texture, resembling a tropical mocktail for an imaginative play experience. The kit lets you design and customize your very own squishy, stretchy, and colorful slime masterpiece. Decorate and customize your slime with adorable pineapple toppings.\r\nThe kit includes everything you need to get started: 2 x Colored & Scented PVA Glue Bottles (pineapple and coconut), 1 x Activator Gel Bottle, 5 x Mixing Sticks, 1 x Cute Container with Pineapple Toppings, 1 x Moisturizer Container, 2 x Slime Storage Containers, 2 x Soft Tissues, and Easy-To-Follow Instruction Manual.\r\nBoth the bright yellow slime with a fruity pineapple fragrance and the smooth white slime infused with the tropical scent of coconut can be blended together to create the tropical Pina Colada slime. The mocktail theme makes it visually appealing and engaging. Add cute pineapple topping decorations to your slime for a creative finishing touch.\r\nThe kit is positioned as a STEM activity, introducing children to the science of polymers, textures, and chemical reactions involved in slime-making. It enhances fine motor skills and sensory development through the tactile experience of slime-making. Delight the senses with vibrant colors, smooth textures, and tropical fragrances. It encourages kids to explore textures, scents, and design.\r\nThe kit is crafted with non-toxic, 100% safe ingredients, ensuring worry-free creativity and peace of mind. It’s also designed to be suitable for all ages, making it perfect for everyone to enjoy.\r\nWhether it’s for a birthday, holiday, or a special treat, this kit makes the perfect present for kids who love crafts and science. It’s ideal for introducing basic STEM concepts in a hands-on, engaging way. Encourage your little scientist to mix, experiment, and learn with this fun-filled slime kit. It’s not just about play; it’s about discovering the exciting world of chemistry through polymers and textures.\r\nDIYScience 2-in-1 Slime Kit is also available with Strawberry Cheesecake, Orange Choco Truffle and Mint Lemonade.',699.00,10.00,630.00,NULL,'toys',5,1,'8+ Above','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:29','2026-03-08 13:38:05',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'DIYScience',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772969007163-865671372.jpg',0),(1457,'DIY SCIENCE ORANGE CHOCO TRUFFLE SLIME KIT FLDSSLM020','8908017463547','Let your creativity run wild with the DIYScience Orange Choco Truffle 2-in-1 Slime Kit. Get ready to create fun where science meets creativity for a delicious experience! The kit combines the rich, tangy aroma of orange with the indulgent scent of chocolate, offering a dessert-themed slime adventure that is both fun and aromatic. Dive into a hands-on experience that’s seriously addictive