 provide fun and engaging activities related to sensory exploration and color mixing. This kit is likely ideal for kids interested in science, tactile play, or sensory activities. Aqua Squish is a fun and magical toy set that lets you create colorful, soft and squishy shapes in just minutes. Aqua Squish contains colorful and non-toxic and eco-friendly materials that are safe for kids so that kids can design for hours of imaginative fun. The playset includes Squishy Goo, Measuring Cups, Culture Powder, Solution Try, Display Jar and an Instruction Manual for designing magical squishes and creating the mentioned designs, encouraging kids to tactile exploration and fine motor skills development. Make Your Squishy Rainbow Noodles in 4 Easy Steps: Prepare the culture solution. Squeeze vibrant squishy goo into a tray filled with Culture Solution. Cure the Noodles. Store and play with your 3D rainbow noodles. Key Features: Safe and Non-Toxic: All materials included are 100% safe for children, ensuring their safety and worry-free crafting experience. Quick Transformation: The Noodles form within minutes, providing immediate satisfaction and encouraging continued play. Not Required Any Sharp Tools: The kit has been designed with child safety in mind, eliminating the need for all those sharp tools. Educational Value: Allow kids to explore concepts like chemical reactions, states of matter, polymer science, mixing, and measuring. Note: Please note that the noodles form only while submerged in water.',499.00,10.00,450.00,NULL,'toys',5,3,'5 to 12 Years','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:29','2026-03-27 04:48:47',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'DIYScience',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772969154139-132816464.jpg',0),(1465,'DIY SCIENCE MAKE YOUR OWN UNICORN EGGS AQUA SQUISH KIT FLAQS02','8908017463639','DIYScience Unicorn Eggs Aqua Squish Kit is a fun and magical toy set that lets you create colorful, soft and squishy shapes in just minutes. Create vibrant and squishy eggs with stunning oozing centers that 