rfect for indoor play, it turns any room into a lively railway adventure for boys and girls.\r\nCARTOON STYLE TOY TRAIN FOR TODDLERS With a cheerful cartoon face inspired by Thomas, this cartoon train toy for toddlers adds a friendly touch to your child\'s toy collection. Its colorful, child-friendly design is appealing for preschoolers and early learners.\r\nSAFE, DURABLE AND CHILD-FRIENDLY MATERIAL Made from sturdy, non-toxic plastic, this rotating railway train toy is safe for toddlers. It’s lightweight, impact-resistant, and built for rough play—perfect for energetic little ones who love action toys.\r\nPERFECT EDUCATIONAL BIRTHDAY GIFT FOR BOYS AND GIRLS Looking for the best birthday gift toy for kids 3+? This battery powered musical toy train makes a thoughtful gift choice for toddlers. It encourages early learning, sensory development, and imaginative pretend play.',499.00,10.00,450.00,NULL,'toys',5,1,'3+Years Above','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:30','2026-03-09 04:35:20',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mallexo',0,0,'/uploads/products/1773030920002-419213689.jpg',0),(1639,'MICKEY MOUSE ZY 6608 5B','ZY-6608-5B','Mickey car toy is a very creative product, with its unique movements and wonderful music; it\'s the best choice for children\'s entertainment. It will help your baby to develop their brain and increase their curiosity. Your kids will be dancing to the beat with this car toy!',399.00,10.00,360.00,NULL,'toys',5,2,'2 to 6 Years','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:30','2026-03-08 15:31:03',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,' ARSDEWY',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772983843067-870272641.jpg',0),(1640,'LOVELY HELLO KITTY ZY 996 8','ZY-996-8','Cute cat with 3D lighting and music available, made up of good quality plastic, kids will surely like this cat. kiity is a very cute toy with lightning and music function, made up of good quality plastic, kids will surely love this new doll. 3D lightning effect will make your child very happy. 3 X AA batteries are required (not included).',399.00,10.00,360.00,NULL,'toys',5,2,'18 to 36 Months','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:30','2026-03-09 15:13:51',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'ARSDEWY',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772983771409-437445161.jpg',0),(1641,'PEGASUS HJ848','ZY-HJ848','Let your child embark on magical adventures with the Electric Horse Toy featuring a Princess Doll! This captivating toy comes to life with walking action, music, and light-up features, offering an interactive and exciting experience. The princess and her horse can walk together, while beautiful music and sparkling lights add extra charm to the play.',999.00,10.00,900.00,NULL,'toys',5,3,'3 to 12 Years','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:30','2026-03-09 15:14:10',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'TONICTOYS',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772983624571-328726542.jpg',0),(1642,'DANCE GIRL HX171','ZY-HX171','Every little girl dreams of putting on a beautiful dress and becoming a lovely princess. This delightful dancing princess robot toy, with its unique packaging design inspired by elements of an ice and snow world, fulfills your child\'s whimsical fantasies, bringing them endless joy. It is an ideal kids toy. Having this girls toy, you no longer need to worry about every collision with the wall, as it behaves like a nimble companion. Whenever it encounters an obstacle, it automatically changes its course, interacting cleverly with the surroundings, injecting more fun and surprises into playtime. Toy for girls are made of high quality ABS material, non-toxic and harmless, protect girls\' safety while playing. With smooth exterior, kids will not hurt their hands when they hold it in their hands.Easily operate.There is no need for a remote control, just flip the switch at the bottom and the robot toys is ready to dance with your child.',699.00,10.00,630.00,NULL,'toys',5,0,'3 to 5 Years','Girl','2026-03-06 01:28:30','2026-07-21 13:42:16',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Generic',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772983527374-27667061.jpeg',0),(1643,'ELECTRONIC UNICORN MZL 01','ZY-MZL-01','Discover the magical world of the Humaira Electronic Unicorn, a delightful toy for kids that combines enchanting features with interactive play. Measuring 16 cm x 12 cm x 17 cm (LxWxH), this unicorn toy boasts transparent wings that add an ethereal charm to its appearance. The lights on its head as hair and on its tail create a mesmerizing glow, making it a captivating sight during playtime. Press the try me button, and this robotic unicorn comes to life, walking, wagging its tail, and emitting a soft whinny sound like a real horse. The bright lights work while the toy is on, adding to the joy and excitement during play. The soft music further enhances the experience, pleasing both your child\'s ears and your own. Crafted with durability in mind, this battery-operated unicorn toy is perfect for long hours of play and is built to withstand the energetic adventures of kids. The sling suspension feature adds an element of fun, making the unicorn bounce and walk gracefully, enhancing the play experience. The Humaira Electronic Unicorn is not only an entertaining toy but also the perfect gift for any child or unicorn lover. With its interactive features, it sparks imaginative play and keeps your child engaged, providing endless moments of joy and wonder.',399.00,10.00,360.00,NULL,'toys',5,0,'3 to 5 Years','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:30','2026-07-15 06:16:30',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,' Humaira',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772983421426-383481422.jpg',0),(1644,'RHUBARB R01C','ZY-R01C','Discover endless fun and imaginative play with Goyal\'s Super Car! This exciting toy vehicle features a transforming figurine that rotates 360° and dazzles with cool light effects. Designed for children aged 3 and up, this toy encourages creativity, hand-eye coordination, and motor skills while providing hours of entertainment. Crafted from safe, high-quality materials, the Super Car is the perfect addition to any child’s playtime collection.',699.00,10.00,630.00,NULL,'toys',5,1,'1 to 10 Years','Unisex','2026-03-06 01:28:30','2026-03-08 15:22:45',37,NULL,NULL,NULL,' Goyal\'s',0,0,'/uploads/products/1772983359200-635282215.jpg',0);
